OL,3,AAustralia 'outraged' after Israeli
OL,4,Adecision not to prosecute over killing
OL,5,Aof aid worker in Gaza
OL,6,
OL,7,FAustralia's foreign minister has said
OL,8,Fshe is "outraged" over an Israeli
OL,9,Fgovernment decision not to prosecute
OL,10,Fthose responsible for the death of aid
OL,11,Fworker Zomi Frankcom, who was killed in
OL,12,Fan IDF strike.
OL,14,FFrankcom was an Australian aid worker
OL,15,Fwith World Central Kitchen (WCK) who
OL,16,Fwas killed in Gaza with six other
OL,17,Fcolleagues by an Israeli airstrike in
OL,18,FApril 2024.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
