OL,3,AAustralia 'outraged' after Israeli
OL,4,Adecision not to prosecute over killing
OL,5,Aof aid worker in Gaza
OL,6,
OL,7,FForeign Minister Penny Wong said in a
OL,8,Fstatement the decision "falls far short
OL,9,Fof the accountability we expect" and
OL,10,Fcalled in the Israeli ambassador.
OL,12,FAfter meeting Wong, Israeli Ambassador
OL,13,FHillel Newman defended the IDF and its
OL,14,Finvestigation, saying "there was no
OL,15,Fcriminal intention" and therefore "no
OL,16,Fcriminal responsibility".
